[1.1e-05, "o", "\r\ngforth-inspect 0.3.0  (log contract 1.1)\r\n\r\n1  every stack:          1 2 3  1.5e  .stacks\r\n2  inside a definition:  10 20 avg .\r\n3  nested calls:         3 4 sum-sq .\r\n4  return stack:         deeper\r\n5  floats:               3e 4e hyp f.   then   1e 0e f/ -0e .stacks fclearstack\r\n6  control flow at compile time:  : t 0 IF BEGIN .cs AGAIN THEN ;\r\n7  plain ~~ shows everything:     all-~~  : t2 ~~ ;  5 t2 drop\r\n8  tag the next snapshots:        s\" step-8\" log-id  7 .stacks drop  s\" \" log-id\r\n9  step through a word:           dbg+  dbg classify   (keys: Enter step, n nest, c continue)\r\n\r\ntour  prints this again.  log-where  shows the log file.  bye  quits.\r\nGforth 0.7.3, Copyright (C) 1995-2008 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\r\nGforth comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY; for details type `license'\r\nType `bye' to exit\r\n"]
